Package: agentlet
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: nano-sized terminal AI agent (streaming, tool-calling, zero deps)
 agentlet streams answers from any OpenAI-compatible chat API, runs
 tools (exec, image_read, video_read) in parallel, accepts image and
 video attachments, and persists sessions as plain JSON — all in
 ~1600 lines of dependency-free Go, shipped as a single binary.
 .
 No config files, no plugins, no telemetry: one file to read, one
 binary to trust.
